  "description": "Shared base of the UniversalOffice libraries: lossless OPC (ZIP) package access with limits for untrusted input, a small XML reader, OOXML units, an SFNT/TrueType font parser (GPOS/GSUB kerning and ligatures) with an index of installed fonts, Liang hyphenation with hyph-utf8 patterns, a dependency-free PDF writer with TrueType subsetting, and a DOM-free DrawingML engine (preset shapes, effects, patterns). Installed as a dependency of UniversalOffice.Docx, UniversalOffice.Xlsx and UniversalOffice.Pptx.",
